{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'f=$(mktemp \"$TMPDIR/lalbarah-rss-mphe-alt.XXXXXX\"); curl -kfsSL --max-time 30 -A '\"'Mozilla/5.0' 'https://www.bing.com/search?format=rss&q=site%3Ahighereducation.mp.gov.in+Balaghat+college' -o \\\"\"'$f\"; rc=$?; printf '\"'RC=%s FILE=%s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$rc\" \"$f\"; if [ \"$rc\" -eq 0 ]; then sed -n '\"'1,160p' \\\"\"'$f\"; fi'","aggregated_output":"RC=0 FILE=/Users/d111879/Documents/Project/DEMO/Student/Student_mobile/sapp/research/agent_runs/madhya-pradesh-government-verified-v2/workspaces/government-college-lal-barah/tmp/lalbarah-rss-mphe-alt.YoMx6X\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\" ?><rss version=\"2.0\"><channel><title>Bing: site:highereducation.mp.gov.in Balaghat college</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3ahighereducation.mp.gov.in+Balaghat+college</link><description>Search results</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>site:highereducation.mp.gov.in Balaghat college</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3ahighereducation.mp.gov.in+Balaghat+college</link></image><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Microsoft. All rights reserved. These XML results may not be used, reproduced or transmitted in any manner or for any purpose other than rendering Bing results within an RSS aggregator for your personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of these results requires express written permission from Microsoft Corporation. By accessing this web page or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright><item><title>Balaghat district - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balaghat_district</link><description>Balaghat district (Hindi pronunciation: [baːlaːgʱaːʈ]) is a district of Madhya Pradesh state in Central India. Its belongs to Jabalpur division. Balaghat city is administrative headquarters of Balaghat district. Balaghat district is located in southeastern part of Madhya Pradesh.</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 21:16:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>District Balaghat, Government of Madhya Pradesh | India</title><link>https://balaghat.nic.in/en/</link><description>Balaghat District a district of Madhya Pradesh state of central India. The town of Balaghat serves as its administrative headquarters. Balaghat is famous for tile factories and rice mills.</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:35:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Balaghat - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balaghat</link><description>Balaghat is located at 21°48′N 80°11′E. [3] It has an average elevation of 288 metres (944 feet). Balaghat is surrounded by dense forests of Satpura, Wainganga River flows through Balaghat. As of the 2011 Census of India, [4] Balaghat had a population of 84,216.</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:39:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Balaghat</title><link>https://balaghat.nic.in/</link><description>बालाघाट जिला (हिंदी: बालाघाट जिला) मध्य प्रदेश राज्य मध्य भारत का एक जिला। बालाघाट शहर अपने प्रशासनिक मुख्यालय के रूप में कार्य करता है। बालाघाट टाइल्स कारखानों और चावल मिलों के लिए प्रसिद्ध है।. और पढ़ें … क्षेत्र: 9245 वर्ग.कि..मी.</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:35:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>10 Best Places to Visit in Balaghat - travelsbliss.com</title><link>https://travelsbliss.com/best-places-to-visit-in-balaghat-madhya-pradesh/</link><description>Balaghat, located in the state of Madhya Pradesh, India, is a district known for its natural beauty, wildlife, and historical significance. Surrounded by lush green forests, hills, and rivers, Balaghat offers a serene environment and a variety of attractions for nature lovers and history enthusiasts.</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:54:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Balaghat News in Hindi, बालाघाट समाचार, बालाघाट न्यूज़, Balaghat ...</title><link>https://navbharatlive.com/madhya-pradesh/balaghat</link><description>Balaghat News in Hindi: Read balaghat news today in hindi covering all local balaghat news, politics, crime, education news. Check for latest बालाघाट न्यूज़, बालाघाट हिन्दी समाचार.</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:38:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Balaghat Madhya Pradesh Tourism, Tourist Guide of Balaghat MP</title><link>https://www.mptourandtravels.com/balaghat/</link><description>Balaghat District is located in the southern part of Jabalpur Division. It occupies the south eastern portion of the Satpura Range and the upper valley of the Wainganga River. The total area of the district is 9,245 km².</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:16:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Balaghat Range, Location, Biodiversity, Conservation</title><link>https://vajiramandravi.com/current-affairs/balaghat-range/</link><description>Balaghat Range is a series of low elevation hills forming an important geographical feature of the Deccan Plateau. It originates from the Harishchandra Range of the Western Ghats and extends southeastward up to the Maharashtra and Karnataka border.</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 08:40:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>बालाघाट - विकिपीडिया</title><link>https://hi.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A4%AC%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%98%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%9F</link><description>बालाघाट वैनगंगा नदी के किनारे दक्षिण–पूर्वी मध्य प्रदेश में स्थित है। यह सतपुड़ा पर्वतमाला के छोर पर मध्य प्रदेश, महाराष्ट्र और छत्तीसगढ की त्रिकोणीय सीमा पर बसा है। इस जिले के 4950 वर्ग किमी ( 53%) भाग में वन है।.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:13:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Balaghat News (बालाघाट न्यूज़): Balaghat News Today, बालाघाट समाचार ...</title><link>https://www.naidunia.com/madhya-pradesh/balaghat</link><description>Balaghat News (बालाघाट न्यूज़) - naidunia provides latest and breaking news headlines (बालाघाट समाचार) from Balaghat, Madhya Pradesh.</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 01:10:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
